<title>AUSTRALIA: Thakral says m.d. Conners dies.</title>
<headline>Thakral says m.d. Conners dies.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel owner and operator Thakral Holdings Ltd said managing director David Conners died suddenly and unexpectedly at home in Sydney on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>Thakral is part of the Thakral Group of Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
